<title>POLAND: KETY SEPT NET DOUBLES TO PLN 3.1 MLN.</title>
<headline>KETY SEPT NET DOUBLES TO PLN 3.1 MLN.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1996-10-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Preliminary results September</p>
<p>(in million zlotys unless stated)</p>
<p>SEPTEMBER</p>
<p> Net profit	     3.08 vs   1.48</p>
<p> Pre-tax profit	 4.10 vs   3.45</p>
<p> Operating profit     3.50 vs   4.04</p>
<p> Sales		   34.71 vs  33.80</p>
<p>JANUARY-SEPTEMBER</p>
<p> Net profit	    22.63 vs  20.79</p>
<p> Pre-tax profit	38.53 vs  31.56</p>
<p> Operating profit    32.56 vs  33.52</p>
<p> Sales		  286.47 vs 283.14</p>
<p>Note. Full name of the Polish aluminium plant is Zaklady</p>
<p>Metali Lekkich Kety SA.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
